{title: Chori Chori Jab Nazare Mili}
{artist: Kumar Sanu Anu Malik}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] [Dm] [Am] [Dm],        Yeh kya hua kaise hua
[Am] [Dm] [Am] [Dm],        Yeh kab hua kya pata
[Dm],        Chori chori jab nazrein mili
[Dm] [Gm],        Chori chori phir neendein udi
[C] [Gm],        Chori chori yeh dil ne kaha
[C] [A] [Dm],        Chori mein bhi hai maza
[Dm] [A] [Bb],        Kya jaane kya mil gaya
[C] [Eb] [A],        Kya jaane kya kho gaya
[Dm] [A] [Bb],        Tune yeh kya kar diya
[C] [Eb] [Bb],        Mujhko yeh kya ho gaya
[A] [Dm] [A] [Dm],        Palkein jhuki palkein uthi
[A] [Dm],        Kya keh diya kya suna
[Bb] [Dm],        Phoolon ke khwaabon mein aakar
[Bb] [Dm],        Khushboo chura le gayi
[Bb] [Dm],        Baadal ka aanchal bhi aakar
[C] [Dm],        O paagal hawa le gayi
Phoolon ke khwaabon mein aakar,        Khushboo chura le gayi
Baadal ka aanchal bhi aakar,        Paagal hawa le gayi
Ek phool ne ek phool se,        Phir kaan mein kuchh kaha
Chori chori jab nazrein mili,        Chori chori phir neendein udi
Chori chori yeh dil ne kaha,        Chori mein bhi hai maza
Rishton ke neele bhanwar,        Kuchh aur gehre huay
Tere mere saaye hain,        Pani pe thehre huay
Jab pyar ka moti gira,        Banne laga daira
Chori chori jab nazrein mili,        Chori chori jab nazarein mili
Chori chori phir neendein udi,        Chori chori yeh dil ne kaha
Chori mein bhi hai maza,        Hay
